  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Vismaz 120 min ieplānotā 2. zonas un apmēram 51 min smaga kardio treniņa nedēļā; kontrolēja enerģiskus blokus otrdien, ceturtdien un sestdien.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, saglabājiet strauju tempu un nepārsniedziet visas pūles. At Active, smagi strādājiet. At Well trained, izmantojiet visas pūles.",
