  "Take 3 slow breaths. Repeat every time you sit down at your desk.": "Take 3 slow breaths. Atkārtojiet katru reizi, kad apsēžaties pie sava rakstāmgalda.",
  "Take a rest day. Keep up your posture habits or go for an easy walk. You can log activity and notes below.": "Take a rest day. Saglabājiet savus stājas ieradumus vai dodieties vieglā pastaigā. Tālāk varat reģistrēt aktivitātes un piezīmes.",
