  "Tuesday, October 27": "Otrdiena, 27. oktobris",
  "Tuesday, October 6": "Otrdiena, 6. oktobris",
  "Tuesday: 4 brisk 20 s bursts. Thursday: 2 rounds of 2 min brisk, well below all-out.": "Otrdien: 4 strauji 20 s. Ceturtdiena: 2 raundi 2 min ātri, krietni mazāk par visu.",
  "Tuesday: 8 × 20 s hard. Thursday: 3 rounds of 4 min, then 4.": "Otrdiena: 8 × 20 s grūti. Ceturtdiena: 3 kārtas pa 4 minūtēm, pēc tam 4.",
  "Tuesday: brisk 20 s bursts with long recoveries. Thursday: 2 controlled rounds of 3 min, building to 3 rounds.": "Otrdiena: strauji 20 s uzliesmojumi ar ilgu atveseļošanos. Ceturtdiena: 2 kontrolēti apļi pa 3 minūtēm, ēka līdz 3 raundiem.",
  "Tuesday: Intervals 1 · 20-second bursts + Zone 2 + back & core": "Otrdiena: intervāli 1 · 20 sekunžu sērijveidā + 2. zona + aizmugure un kodols",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at {hr:85-95}.": "Otrdiena: divi 8 × 20 s bloki. Ceturtdiena: pilna norvēģu 4×4 pie {hr:85-95}.",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "Otrdiena: divi 8 × 20 s bloki. Ceturtdiena: pilns norvēģu 4×4 ar 159–178 sitieniem minūtē.",
